              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "किशोरः — kiśoraḥ — \"a lad\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "किशोरः क्रीडांगणे कन्दुकेन क्रीडति। kiśoraḥ krīḍāṅgaṇe kandukena krīḍati. The lad plays ball in the playground."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A masculine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "किशोरः (kiśoraḥ) MW's first sense is \"a colt\", then \"a youth, a lad\"; MW gives no derivation, so its origin is uncertain (MW)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
